# Flat (npm-style) node_modules. REQUIRED for Colyseus: its matchMaker
# singleton lives in @colyseus/core, and the Server (imported from core)
# and WebSocketTransport (separate package, peers on core) must share ONE
# copy. pnpm's isolated layout installs two core copies (circular peer
# dep core <-> ws-transport), which breaks every WS join with
# "seat reservation expired" (verified 2026-11-10). Hoisting guarantees
# a single instance. See AGENTS.md.
node-linker=hoisted
